      "name": "Bloodbird",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "curse",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "A creature hit by a vilderavn's melee attack becomes cursed. It takes 2d6 persistent bleed damage that's difficult to stanch.\n\nThe DC to stop the bleeding using Administer First Aid is 35, and healing the creature to full HP doesn't automatically end the bleeding.\n\nRemoving the curse ends the bleeding."
    },
